OL,3,ADuran Duran drummer quits band due to
OL,4,Atinnitus
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuran Duran drummer Roger Taylor said
OL,7,Fhe will leave the band due to his
OL,8,Fworsening tinnitus.
OL,10,FTaylor has been the chart-topping
OL,11,Fgroup's drummer since they formed in
OL,12,FBirmingham in 1978, which he described
OL,13,Fas "the joy of my life", but said he
OL,14,Fhad "reached the point where I must now
OL,15,Flisten to my body and my doctors".
OL,17,FThe 66-year-old said his condition has
OL,18,Fbeen getting steadily worse, leading to
OL,19,Fhim making one of his hardest decisions
OL,20,Fto quit the band.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
